  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Flood Emergency Response Chikwawa 2019</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2.295 flood affected beneficiaries in 459 households.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In response to the heavy flooding of our target areas along the Shire river in project 1014 we have been offered funding from the German embassy to respond in WASH. We will concentrate on safe access to clean drinking water, complemented by hygiene promotion and food aid, if necessary.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provide access to food and improved WASH supply (drinking water, waste management in the camp) for people severely affected by the flood</narrative>
  </description>
